      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i know. i can call a professional. but they aren't the ones who were there. they don't get how it feels to be completely erased by everyone you thought knew you. it’s not just being sad, it’s like the world has just moved on and left me in a vacuum. there’s no coming back from this, is there? it feels like the version of me that existed is just... gone for good.",
